IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgd-acquisition`
IMPORT `sg-proc-compulsory-acquisition`

-- Tests for sg-proc-compulsory-acquisition.l4 (ss 215 and 215AA of the Companies Act 1967: the chain of compulsory acquisition of shares after a take-over offer).
-- Every expected outcome below was written from the text (src:20595-21004 of CoA1967.txt) before the module was run, never copied from its output.
-- A trace that does not match is a finding. Day 0 of each trace is the day the TIMELINE line above the rule in the module names.
-- Days used with the offer made on 1 January 2026 (day 0): 1 March = 59, 11 March = 69, 5 April = 94, 11 April = 100, 19 April = 108, 1 May = 120, 2 May = 121.

§ `Helpers: periods turned into days`

-- 4 months from 1 January 2026 end on 1 May 2026; 2 months from 1 March end on 1 May; 2 years from 1 January 2026 end on 1 January 2028; 10 years on 1 January 2036 (leap days in 2028 and 2032).
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the event to the last day of a period after it` (Date 1 1 2026) 4 Months EQUALS 120
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the event to the last day of a period after it` (Date 1 3 2026) 2 Months EQUALS 61
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the event to the last day of a period after it` (Date 10 3 2026) 1 Months EQUALS 31
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the event to the last day of a period after it` (Date 10 4 2026) 3 Months EQUALS 91
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the event to the last day of a period after it` (Date 1 1 2026) 2 Years EQUALS 730
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the event to the last day of a period after it` (Date 1 1 2026) 10 Years EQUALS 3652

-- Notice on 11 March: one month ends on 11 April (31 days). A statement posted on 5 April gives 14 days to 19 April, the later (39 days). A statement posted on 1 March gives 15 March, so the one month is the later (31 days).
#ASSERT `s 215(1) chain: the days from the notice to the last day of the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING EQUALS 31
#ASSERT `s 215(1) chain: the days from the notice to the last day of the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Date 11 3 2026) (JUST (Date 5 4 2026)) EQUALS 39
#ASSERT `s 215(1) chain: the days from the notice to the last day of the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Date 11 3 2026) (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) EQUALS 31

§ `Cases`

GIVETH A `s 215(1) share count`
`the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` MEANS `s 215(1) share count` 1000 0 0 0 0 900

GIVETH A `s 215(1) share count`
`the register: 1000 shares in issue, 899 held by the approving holders` MEANS `s 215(1) share count` 1000 0 0 0 0 899

GIVETH A `s 215(3) share count`
`the register: 1000 shares, 950 now held by the transferee` MEANS `s 215(3) share count` 1000 950 0 0

GIVETH A `s 215(3) share count`
`the register: 1000 shares, 890 now held by the transferee` MEANS `s 215(3) share count` 1000 890 0 0

GIVEN `the approval day` IS A DATE
      `the notice day` IS A DATE
      `the statement day` IS A MAYBE DATE
      counts IS A `s 215(1) share count`
      `the shareholder dissents` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice is in the prescribed manner` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the period of all convenient speed, as found` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 215 chain act`
`case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` MEANS
    `s 215(1) chain: the approval within 4 months, the notice within 2 months, the application to the Court, then the payment` (Member "Holders") (Company "Bidco") (Member "Dissenter") `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` counts (Date 1 1 2026) `the approval day` `the shareholder dissents` `the notice is in the prescribed manner` `the notice day` `the statement day` `the period of all convenient speed, as found`

GIVEN counts IS A `s 215(3) share count`
      `the transferee has already complied` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the holder has not assented` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 215 chain act`
`case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` MEANS
    `s 215(3) chain: the notice of the 90% within one month, the holder's requirement within 3 months, and the acquisition` (Company "Bidco") (Member "Holder") counts FALSE `the transferee has already complied` `the holder has not assented` (Date 10 3 2026) `the notice day`

§ `s 215(1): the chain from the offer to the payment`

-- Approval on 1 March (day 59), notice on 11 March (day 69), no application by the last day (11 April, day 100): the transferee's duties of subsection (4) follow, and are done on day 102.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(1) the transferee gives notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` AT 69
    (WAITUNTIL 101)
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(a) the transferee transmits a copy of the notice and the executed instrument of transfer to the transferor company` AT 102
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(b) the transferee pays, allots or transfers the price of the shares to the transferor company` AT 102

-- The same, with the duties of subsection (4) not yet done: they are open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(1) the transferee gives notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` AT 69
    (WAITUNTIL 101)

-- An application on day 79, within the month; the Court orders otherwise on day 85: the transferee is not bound and owes nothing.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(1) the transferee gives notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` AT 69
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder applies to the Court for an order that the transferee is not bound to acquire the shares` AT 79
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215(1) the Court orders that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire the shares` AT 85

-- An application on day 79; the Court disposes of it on day 85 without ordering to the contrary; the transferee transmits on day 90 and pays on day 91.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(1) the transferee gives notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` AT 69
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder applies to the Court for an order that the transferee is not bound to acquire the shares` AT 79
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215(1) the Court disposes of the application without ordering to the contrary` AT 85
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(a) the transferee transmits a copy of the notice and the executed instrument of transfer to the transferor company` AT 90
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(b) the transferee pays, allots or transfers the price of the shares to the transferor company` AT 91

-- The application is disposed of without an order to the contrary and the transferee has done nothing yet: its duties are open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(1) the transferee gives notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` AT 69
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder applies to the Court for an order that the transferee is not bound to acquire the shares` AT 79
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215(1) the Court disposes of the application without ordering to the contrary` AT 85

-- The application on the last day of the month (11 April, day 100) is in time; the Court orders otherwise on day 105.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(1) the transferee gives notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` AT 69
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder applies to the Court for an order that the transferee is not bound to acquire the shares` AT 100
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215(1) the Court orders that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire the shares` AT 105

-- A statement posted on 5 April (day 94) extends the time to 14 days after it, 19 April (day 108): an application on day 108 is in time, and the Court orders otherwise on day 110.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) (JUST (Date 5 4 2026)) `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(1) the transferee gives notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` AT 69
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder applies to the Court for an order that the transferee is not bound to acquire the shares` AT 108
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215(1) the Court orders that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire the shares` AT 110

-- Approval after the 4 months (2 May, day 121; the last day is 1 May): the transferee never gets the power to give notice, and nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 2 5 2026) (Date 11 5 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 121

-- Approval on the last day of the 4 months (1 May, day 120): in time, so the transferee's power to give notice is open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 11 5 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 120

-- The gate fails: 899 of 1000 is under 90%, so the approval does not reach the requisite number and the chain ends with nothing owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 899 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59

-- Notice after the 2 months (2 May, day 121; approval 1 March, the last day is 1 May): no notice under subsection (1), so no payment duty.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the chain from an offer made on 1 January 2026` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 2 5 2026) NOTHING `the register: 1000 shares in issue, 900 held by the approving holders` TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Holders" DOES `s 215(1) the holders of not less than 90% of the shares approve the scheme or contract` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(1) the transferee gives notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` AT 121

§ `s 215(4): the payment duty and its gate`

-- Day 0 is the first day the transferee must act. Both duties done, in the order (a) then (b).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(4) chain: the transferee must transmit the notice and pay, but only once a notice has been given and the Court has not ordered to the contrary` (Company "Bidco") TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(a) the transferee transmits a copy of the notice and the executed instrument of transfer to the transferor company` AT 0
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(b) the transferee pays, allots or transfers the price of the shares to the transferor company` AT 3

-- Notice given, no order to the contrary, nothing done by day 400: the transferee has neither transmitted the notice nor paid within the period of all convenient speed (30 days, found as an input).
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: the section module for s 215(4) now carries the found period, so a transferee that does neither within it is in BREACH and not left with an open duty for ever (src:20741-20761)
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(4) chain: the transferee must transmit the notice and pay, but only once a notice has been given and the Court has not ordered to the contrary` (Company "Bidco") TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- No notice has been given: the payment duty is not owing, however long one waits.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(4) chain: the transferee must transmit the notice and pay, but only once a notice has been given and the Court has not ordered to the contrary` (Company "Bidco") FALSE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- The Court has ordered to the contrary on the dissenter's application: nothing is owing.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(4) chain: the transferee must transmit the notice and pay, but only once a notice has been given and the Court has not ordered to the contrary` (Company "Bidco") TRUE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Notice given, no order to the contrary: the transmission on day 30, the last day of the period of 30 days, and the payment on day 30.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(4) chain: the transferee must transmit the notice and pay, but only once a notice has been given and the Court has not ordered to the contrary` (Company "Bidco") TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(a) the transferee transmits a copy of the notice and the executed instrument of transfer to the transferor company` AT 30
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(b) the transferee pays, allots or transfers the price of the shares to the transferor company` AT 30

-- The transmission is on day 0 and the payment on day 31, one day after the period of 30 days: the transferee's duty to pay is late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(4) chain: the transferee must transmit the notice and pay, but only once a notice has been given and the Court has not ordered to the contrary` (Company "Bidco") TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(a) the transferee transmits a copy of the notice and the executed instrument of transfer to the transferor company` AT 0
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(4)(b) the transferee pays, allots or transfers the price of the shares to the transferor company` AT 31

§ `s 215(2): the demand for the statement`

-- Notice on 11 March = day 0. The demand on day 10 and the company supplies the statement on day 12.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(2) chain: the dissenting shareholder may demand the statement within one month and the transferor company must supply it` (Member "Dissenter") (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 11 3 2026) 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder serves a written demand for the statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(2) the transferor company supplies the statement and posts it to the dissenting shareholder` AT 12

-- The demand on day 10, no statement yet: the company's duty is open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 215(2) chain: the dissenting shareholder may demand the statement within one month and the transferor company must supply it` (Member "Dissenter") (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 11 3 2026) 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder serves a written demand for the statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders` AT 10

-- The demand on the last day of the month (11 April, day 31) is in time; the statement on day 33.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(2) chain: the dissenting shareholder may demand the statement within one month and the transferor company must supply it` (Member "Dissenter") (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 11 3 2026) 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder serves a written demand for the statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders` AT 31
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(2) the transferor company supplies the statement and posts it to the dissenting shareholder` AT 33

-- No notice has been given: no demand can be made and nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(2) chain: the dissenting shareholder may demand the statement within one month and the transferor company must supply it` (Member "Dissenter") (Company "Target") FALSE (Date 11 3 2026) 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 40)

-- The demand on day 10; the company supplies the statement on day 40, the last day of the period of 30 days after the demand.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(2) chain: the dissenting shareholder may demand the statement within one month and the transferor company must supply it` (Member "Dissenter") (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 11 3 2026) 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder serves a written demand for the statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(2) the transferor company supplies the statement and posts it to the dissenting shareholder` AT 40

-- The demand on day 10; the company supplies the statement on day 41, one day after the period: late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(2) chain: the dissenting shareholder may demand the statement within one month and the transferor company must supply it` (Member "Dissenter") (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 11 3 2026) 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder serves a written demand for the statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(2) the transferor company supplies the statement and posts it to the dissenting shareholder` AT 41

§ `s 215(1A) and (1B): alternative terms`

-- Notice on 11 March = day 0; the election on day 20 is in time.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(1A) chain: the dissenting shareholder may elect between the alternative terms within the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Member "Dissenter") TRUE TRUE (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(1A) the dissenting shareholder elects which of the alternative terms the shareholder prefers` AT 20

-- With a statement posted on 5 April the time runs to 19 April, day 39: an election on day 39 is in time.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(1A) chain: the dissenting shareholder may elect between the alternative terms within the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Member "Dissenter") TRUE TRUE (Date 11 3 2026) (JUST (Date 5 4 2026)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Dissenter" DOES `s 215(1A) the dissenting shareholder elects which of the alternative terms the shareholder prefers` AT 39

-- Alternative terms were offered but no notice has been given under subsection (1): the dissenting shareholder has nothing to elect.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(1A) chain: the dissenting shareholder may elect between the alternative terms within the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Member "Dissenter") TRUE FALSE (Date 11 3 2026) NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 40)

-- Alternative terms were offered and the transferee has not yet said which terms apply on a failure to elect: the duty is open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 215(1B) chain: the transferee must state which of the alternative terms is to apply on a failure to elect` (Company "Bidco") TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- No alternative terms were offered: nothing to state.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(1B) chain: the transferee must state which of the alternative terms is to apply on a failure to elect` (Company "Bidco") FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

§ `s 215(3): the sell-out leg`

-- Transfer on 10 March = day 0. Notice on day 20 (30 March); the holder requires acquisition on day 50; the transferee acquires on day 60.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` `the register: 1000 shares, 950 now held by the transferee` FALSE TRUE (Date 30 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(3)(a) the transferee gives notice that the transfers have reached 90% to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` AT 20
    PARTY Member "Holder" DOES `s 215(3)(b) the holder requires the transferee to acquire the shares in question` AT 50
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(3) the transferee acquires the shares that the holder requires it to acquire` AT 60

-- Notice on the last day of the month (10 April, day 31); the holder requires on the last day of the 3 months (10 July, day 122); the transferee acquires on day 125.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` `the register: 1000 shares, 950 now held by the transferee` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 4 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(3)(a) the transferee gives notice that the transfers have reached 90% to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` AT 31
    PARTY Member "Holder" DOES `s 215(3)(b) the holder requires the transferee to acquire the shares in question` AT 122
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(3) the transferee acquires the shares that the holder requires it to acquire` AT 125

-- The holder requires on day 122 and the transferee has not acquired: its duty is open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` `the register: 1000 shares, 950 now held by the transferee` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 4 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(3)(a) the transferee gives notice that the transfers have reached 90% to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` AT 31
    PARTY Member "Holder" DOES `s 215(3)(b) the holder requires the transferee to acquire the shares in question` AT 122

-- Notice on day 31, and the holder does not require within the 3 months: the holder's right has lapsed and nothing more is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` `the register: 1000 shares, 950 now held by the transferee` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 4 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(3)(a) the transferee gives notice that the transfers have reached 90% to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` AT 31
    (WAITUNTIL 123)

-- No notice by the end of the month (day 32): the transferee has failed the duty of subsection (3)(a).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` `the register: 1000 shares, 950 now held by the transferee` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 4 2026) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 32)

-- Notice given on day 32, one day after the last day.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` `the register: 1000 shares, 950 now held by the transferee` FALSE TRUE (Date 11 4 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(3)(a) the transferee gives notice that the transfers have reached 90% to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` AT 32

-- The gate fails: 890 of 1000 is under 90%, so no duty of subsection (3)(a) arises.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` `the register: 1000 shares, 890 now held by the transferee` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 4 2026) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 40)

-- The late notice and the holder's position: the notice is given on day 40, after the one month, and the holder would require the acquisition on day 60, inside 3 months from that notice.
-- A limit of the terminal BREACH: the late notice ends the rule in BREACH on day 32, so the holder's 3 months, which the text runs "from the giving of the notice to such holder" (src:20717-20718), never start here, and the holder's right to require is not shown.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the sell-out leg after a transfer on 10 March 2026` `the register: 1000 shares, 950 now held by the transferee` FALSE TRUE (Date 19 4 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215(3)(a) the transferee gives notice that the transfers have reached 90% to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` AT 40
    PARTY Member "Holder" DOES `s 215(3)(b) the holder requires the transferee to acquire the shares in question` AT 60

§ `s 215(4) and (5): registration, bank account and trust`

-- Day 0 is the day the company receives the copy, the instrument and the price (sums of money).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(4) and (5) chain: the transferor company must register the transferee, bank the sums and hold them in trust once it has received them` (Company "Target") TRUE TRUE 10 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(4) the transferor company registers the transferee as the holder of the shares` AT 1
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(5) the transferor company pays the sums it received into a separate bank account` AT 1
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(5) the transferor company holds the sums and other consideration in trust for the persons entitled` AT 2

-- The company has received everything and has done nothing by day 30: it has not registered the transferee "thereupon", within the period the standard of time allows (10 days, found as an input), so it is in BREACH; the holding in trust, a duty that holds throughout, has no clock.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: the section module for s 215(4) now carries the found period of its own standard "thereupon", so the registration that is not made within it is the company's breach (src:20760)
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(4) and (5) chain: the transferor company must register the transferee, bank the sums and hold them in trust once it has received them` (Company "Target") TRUE TRUE 10 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 30)

-- The gate fails: the company has received nothing from the transferee, so none of the three duties is owing.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(4) and (5) chain: the transferor company must register the transferee, bank the sums and hold them in trust once it has received them` (Company "Target") FALSE TRUE 10 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 30)

-- Registration on day 10, the last day of the period "thereupon" found as 10 days; the bank account and the trust on day 10.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(4) and (5) chain: the transferor company must register the transferee, bank the sums and hold them in trust once it has received them` (Company "Target") TRUE TRUE 10 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(4) the transferor company registers the transferee as the holder of the shares` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(5) the transferor company pays the sums it received into a separate bank account` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(5) the transferor company holds the sums and other consideration in trust for the persons entitled` AT 10

-- Registration on day 11, one day after the period found for "thereupon": late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(4) and (5) chain: the transferor company must register the transferee, bank the sums and hold them in trust once it has received them` (Company "Target") TRUE TRUE 10 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(4) the transferor company registers the transferee as the holder of the shares` AT 11
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(5) the transferor company pays the sums it received into a separate bank account` AT 11
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(5) the transferor company holds the sums and other consideration in trust for the persons entitled` AT 11

-- Registration on day 1 and the trust on day 2, but the sums are paid into a separate bank account only on day 31, one day after the period of all convenient speed (30 days): late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(4) and (5) chain: the transferor company must register the transferee, bank the sums and hold them in trust once it has received them` (Company "Target") TRUE TRUE 10 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(4) the transferor company registers the transferee as the holder of the shares` AT 1
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(5) the transferor company holds the sums and other consideration in trust for the persons entitled` AT 2
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(5) the transferor company pays the sums it received into a separate bank account` AT 31

§ `s 215(6) and (7): the transfer to the Official Receiver`

-- Money received on 1 January 2026 = day 0. A transfer on day 731 (the first day after the 2 years, 730) is permitted; the Official Receiver deals with the moneys on day 735.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 731
    PARTY `Official Receiver` DOES `s 215(7)(a) the Official Receiver deals with the moneys as if they were paid under section 197 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` AT 735

-- A transfer on day 730, the last day of the 2 years, is before the expiration of the 2 years.
-- Closed route, not a breach: the text gives only a power "after the expiration of 2 years" and lays no bar before it, so the early transfer does not count; the company still holds the money in trust and the duty to transfer before the expiration of 10 years is still owed, so the rule stays open.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: an early transfer is an act the subsection does not authorise and it is not a breach, as the module's own fork on "must, after" in s 215(4) says (src:20775-20776)
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 730

-- A transfer on the last day of the 10 years (day 3652) is in time.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 3652
    PARTY `Official Receiver` DOES `s 215(7)(a) the Official Receiver deals with the moneys as if they were paid under section 197 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` AT 3655

-- A transfer on day 3653, one day after the 10 years: late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 3653

-- No transfer by day 3653: the company has not transferred before the expiration of the 10 years.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 3653)

-- Other consideration, not money: transferred on day 800; the Official Receiver sells or disposes of it on day 810.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) FALSE TRUE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 800
    PARTY `Official Receiver` DOES `s 215(7)(b) the Official Receiver sells or disposes of the other consideration and deals with the proceeds as if they were moneys paid under section 197` AT 810

-- The gate fails: nothing is held in trust under the section, so there is no duty and no permission to transfer.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 800)

-- An early transfer on day 100 does not count: the company still holds the money in trust and nothing is transferred by day 3653, so the duty to transfer before the expiration of 10 years is broken.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 100
    (WAITUNTIL 3653)

-- An early transfer on day 100 does not count, and the company transfers on day 800, after the 2 years: that transfer counts, and the Official Receiver deals with the moneys on day 810.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 100
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 800
    PARTY `Official Receiver` DOES `s 215(7)(a) the Official Receiver deals with the moneys as if they were paid under section 197 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` AT 810

-- The company transfers on day 800 and the Official Receiver deals with the moneys on day 830, the last day of the period of 30 days after the transfer.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 800
    PARTY `Official Receiver` DOES `s 215(7)(a) the Official Receiver deals with the moneys as if they were paid under section 197 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` AT 830

-- The company transfers on day 800 and the Official Receiver deals with the moneys on day 831, one day after the period of all convenient speed: late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 215(6) and (7) chain: the company may transfer after 2 years and must before 10 years, then the Official Receiver deals with it` (Company "Target") TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Target" DOES `s 215(6) the company holding the money or other consideration transfers it to the Official Receiver` AT 800
    PARTY `Official Receiver` DOES `s 215(7)(a) the Official Receiver deals with the moneys as if they were paid under section 197 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` AT 831

§ `s 215AA(6): the joint transferees' notice`

-- An offer for all the shares by 2 persons jointly: both join in making the notice.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215AA(6) chain: the joint transferees must make the notice together` (Company "Bidco") (Company "Cobid") TRUE 2 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215AA(6) a joint transferee joins in making the notice, and a joint transferee that is a company has a director sign it` AT 1
    PARTY Company "Cobid" DOES `s 215AA(6) a joint transferee joins in making the notice, and a joint transferee that is a company has a director sign it` AT 2

-- Only one of the two has joined: the other's duty is open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 215AA(6) chain: the joint transferees must make the notice together` (Company "Bidco") (Company "Cobid") TRUE 2 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Bidco" DOES `s 215AA(6) a joint transferee joins in making the notice, and a joint transferee that is a company has a director sign it` AT 1

-- The gate fails: an offer by one person is not a joint offer, so section 215AA(6) puts no duty on anyone.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215AA(6) chain: the joint transferees must make the notice together` (Company "Bidco") (Company "Cobid") TRUE 1 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

